WEBVTT

00:13:58.959 --> 00:14:04.752
SC:... my mindset was that my goal was
to publish something by the time I was 75.

00:14:04.776 --> 00:14:07.276
I really had no expectation,

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:11.829
and I was purposely doing that because
I loved this act of writing so much

00:14:11.853 --> 00:14:18.359
that I didn't want everyday concerns
to come in between me and it,

00:14:18.383 --> 00:14:21.375
and so, I set up this little consultancy

00:14:21.399 --> 00:14:24.045
where I was training people
in negotiation skills,

00:14:24.069 --> 00:14:26.416
and I was making enough
of a living doing that,

00:14:26.440 --> 00:14:29.271
and I could have done that
forever, presumably.

00:14:29.295 --> 00:14:32.293
And I thought, "OK,
so I'm just doing this hobby."